message.content:
{"diagnosis": "Loopback send 0xa5 was never received, giving `TRAP: uart timeout, no byte received` and `FAIL 0xdead` instead of a received byte. recv_state stays at 0 instead of advancing to 1 on start-bit low, so receiver never enters sampling states. Root cause in picosoc/simpleuart.v:78-81: `if (!ser_rx) recv_state <= 0;` self-loops in idle; CONE_SLICE has 0/1 coverage for this cone so trace+excerpt win.", "patch_diff": "diff --git a/picosoc/simpleuart.v b/picosoc/simpleuart.v
--- a/picosoc/simpleuart.v
+++ b/picosoc/simpleuart.v
@@ -77,7 +77,7 @@
 			case (recv_state)
 				0: begin
 					if (!ser_rx)
- 						recv_state <= 0;
+ 						recv_state <= 1;
 					recv_divcnt <= 0;
 				end
", "expected": "tohost PASS with loopback byte 0xa5 received, no `TRAP: uart timeout`"}

